            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Those Reunion members skulking around... are they our targets?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "By the looks of things, they don't know that we've completely surrounded them yet."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "They seem to be building something around the entire block."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "If I'm not mistaken, this is one of the central hubs that connects Reunion's various bases."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "If we destroy the communication facility here, we can deliver a crippling blow to their forces in this area."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "That would put us one step closer to recapturing the L.G.D. Headquarters."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Your call."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Also, I can't stop thinking about the details of the intel report."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "You mean, that part about Reunion's objective not just being the construction of a forward base?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "That's right."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "'Enemies are secretly looking for an extremely high-value target. It is necessary to determine their actions first.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "What are they doing in the wealthy districts? What kind of high-value target are they trying to find there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "It seems a bit fishy to me as well. According to our previous plans, all the buildings here should already have been evacuated."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "If Reunion is planning to kidnap one of the moguls, they probably won't find them here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "When are we going to make our move? Scouting doesn't seem to be Reunion's strong suit, so we can carry out our raid at any time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "They're probably used to always being the hunters, not the prey."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Now that it's their turn to be the prey, they'll be hunted down in no time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Let's continue observing them carefully for now. Our priority is to find out what their objectives are, not to engage them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "It's easy enough to go in and destroy them, but it'll take patience to find out what they're after."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_136_hsguma",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma",
        "text": "Understood."
    },
